{"speciesId":606,"names":{"fr":"Neitram","es":"Beheeyem","en":"Beheeyem","ja":"オーベム"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il peut manipuler les souvenirs de ses ennemis et fait clignoter ses doigts tricolores pour discuter avec ses amis."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It can manipulate an opponent’s memory. Apparently, it communicates by flashing its three different-colored fingers."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il manipule l’esprit avec ses pouvoirs psychiques et peut modifier les images conservées dans les souvenirs."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It uses psychic power to control an opponent’s brain and tamper with its memories."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Apparently, it communicates by flashing its three fingers, but those patterns haven’t been decoded."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Apparently, it communicates by flashing its three fingers, but those patterns haven’t been decoded."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il fait clignoter ses doigts tricolores pour communiquer avec ses semblables. Son langage reste un mystère."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Parece que se comunica haciendo brillar sus dedos tricolores, pero nadie ha conseguido descifrar aún su patrón."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Apparently, it communicates by flashing its three fingers, but those patterns haven’t been decoded."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"指先を 点滅 させて 会話するらしいが その パターンは まだ 解読 できていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il manipule l’esprit avec ses pouvoirs psychiques et peut modifier les images conservées dans les souvenirs."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Controla el cerebro del rival con su poder psíquico y manipula sus recuerdos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It uses psychic power to control an opponent’s brain and tamper with its memories."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"サイコパワーで 相手の 脳みそを 操り 記憶する 映像を 違う ものに 書き換えてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il fait clignoter ses doigts tricolores pour communiquer avec ses semblables. Son langage reste un mystère."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Parece que se comunica haciendo brillar sus dedos tricolores, pero nadie ha conseguido descifrar aún su patrón."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Apparently, it communicates by flashing its three fingers, but those patterns haven’t been decoded."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"指先を 点滅 させて 会話するらしいが その パターンは まだ 解読 できていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il manipule l’esprit avec ses pouvoirs psychiques et peut modifier les images conservées dans les souvenirs."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Controla el cerebro del rival con su poder psíquico y manipula sus recuerdos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It uses psychic power to control an opponent’s brain and tamper with its memories."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"サイコパワーで 相手の 脳みそを 操り 記憶する 映像を 違う ものに 書き換えてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il peut modifier les souvenirs avec ses pouvoirs psychiques. Vous ne le savez pas encore, mais vous avez peut-être déjà tout oublié..."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Es capaz de alterar los recuerdos de sus rivales gracias a su poder psíquico. De hecho, quizá ya haya alterado los tuyos y no lo sepas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"With its psychic powers, it rewrites its opponents’ memories. You, too, may have already had your memories rewritten."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"サイコパワーで 相手の 記憶を 書き換えてしまう。 あなたも 既に 書き換えられているかも しれない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ses pouvoirs psychiques sont redoutables. Il peut contrôler ses adversaires et modifier leurs souvenirs grâce à ses doigts tricolores."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Este Pokémon, de un poder psíquico increíble, controla a sus oponentes y altera sus recuerdos mediante la luz de sus dedos tricolores."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It has strong psychic powers. Using its fingers that flash three different colors, it controls its opponents and rewrites their memories."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"強い サイコパワーを 持っている。 ３色に 光る 指で 相手を 操り 記憶を 書き換えてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"À chaque fois que Neitram se matérialise dans une pâture, un Moumouflon disparaît dans des circonstances mystérieuses."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Por algún extraño motivo, siempre que se avista un Beheeyem en una granja desaparece un Dubwool."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Whenever a Beheeyem visits a farm, a Dubwool mysteriously disappears."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"オーベムが 現れた 牧場 からは いつの間にか バイウールーが １匹 姿を 消してしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il peut manipuler les souvenirs de son adversaire à loisir. Parfois, on l’aperçoit en train de vagabonder au-dessus des champs de blé."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Es capaz de manipular los recuerdos del rival. Se lo avista en ocasiones vagando por campos de trigo."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Sometimes found drifting above wheat fields, this Pokémon can control the memories of its opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"相手の 記憶を 操作できる。 麦畑の 上を さまよう 姿が ときおり 目撃される。"}],"varieties":[{"id":606,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[11,"level-up",18],[14,"level-up",18],[15,"level-up",18],[16,"level-up",18],[17,"level-up",18],[18,"level-up",18],[20,"level-up",30]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",4],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",4],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",4],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",4],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[11,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",15],[1